NODD implements the ODD workflow created by Gentleman-Programming
(https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming). The methodology, its seven
canonical steps and its delegation rules are his work; this project is an
independent implementation that enforces them at runtime. The MIT grant below
covers this implementation's own source code only, and makes no claim over ODD
itself.

Quoted ODD clauses appear in .sdd/nodd/requirements.md for the sole purpose of
verifying parity, and remain the property of their author.

